{"seq":2,"slug":"pediatric-nursing-essentials","title":"儿科护理要点","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/specialty-nursing/pediatric-nursing-essentials","wordCount":1105,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"儿科护理要点\">儿科护理要点</h1><p>带教老师有句话我一直记着：&quot;儿童不是缩小版的成人。&quot;在儿科病房，这句话天天在应验：同样的退烧药，给孩子的剂量要按体重精算；同样是肺炎，孩子可能几小时内就喘不上气；孩子还不会准确说哪里不舒服，全靠护士去观察。儿科护理的难，就难在这些&quot;特殊&quot;上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><ul>\n<li>儿童处于<strong>生长发育</strong>中，不同年龄段的解剖生理和护理重点差异很大。</li>\n<li>儿科用药剂量通常按<strong>体重或体表面积</strong>计算，绝不能照搬成人剂量。</li>\n<li>儿童病情<strong>变化快</strong>，代偿能力强但失代偿也突然，护士要善于捕捉早期信号。</li>\n<li>常见儿科问题包括<strong>高热惊厥、腹泻脱水、呼吸道感染</strong>，护理各有重点。</li>\n<li>儿科护理离不开<strong>家长沟通与心理安抚</strong>，孩子的配合度直接影响护理效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"儿科用药-剂量按体重算\">儿科用药：剂量按体重算</h3><p>成人一片药，孩子可能只能吃几分之一。最常用的是按体重计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>患儿剂量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>每公斤体重剂量</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>体重（kg）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{患儿剂量} = \\text{每公斤体重剂量} \\times \\text{体重（kg）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">患儿剂量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每公斤体重剂量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">体重（</span><span class=\"mord\">kg</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如某药每公斤每次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext> mg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\ \\text{mg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg</span></span></span></span></span></span>，一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mtext> kg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\ \\text{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的孩子单次剂量就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn><mtext> mg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10 \\times 15 = 150\\ \\text{mg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg</span></span></span></span></span></span>。这就是为什么儿科护士必须先准确称体重——算错剂量在儿科是致命错误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"高热惊厥-先保安全\">高热惊厥：先保安全</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[患儿高热惊厥发作] --&gt; B[就地侧卧 防误吸跌伤]&#10;    B --&gt; C[松解衣领 保持气道通畅]&#10;    C --&gt; D[不强行撬开牙关 不强按肢体]&#10;    D --&gt; E[记录发作时间 立即通知医生]&#10;    E --&gt; F[退热 防再发作]\">flowchart TD\n    A[患儿高热惊厥发作] --&gt; B[就地侧卧 防误吸跌伤]\n    B --&gt; C[松解衣领 保持气道通畅]\n    C --&gt; D[不强行撬开牙关 不强按肢体]\n    D --&gt; E[记录发作时间 立即通知医生]\n    E --&gt; F[退热 防再发作]</pre><p>高热惊厥多见于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 个月到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 岁的孩子。发作时家长最容易慌乱去掐人中、撬嘴塞东西，这些都是错误且危险的。护士要做的是：让孩子侧卧防误吸、保持气道通畅、不强行约束、记录抽搐时长、尽快降温。多数高热惊厥短暂且预后好，但护士的冷静处置能避免二次伤害。</p>\n<h3 id=\"腹泻与脱水-看脱水程度补液\">腹泻与脱水：看脱水程度补液</h3><p>婴幼儿腹泻最怕脱水，护士要会判断脱水程度并指导补液。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>脱水程度</th>\n<th>主要表现</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轻度</td>\n<td>略口渴、尿量稍减</td>\n<td>口服补液盐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中度</td>\n<td>眼窝凹陷、皮肤弹性差、烦躁</td>\n<td>口服或静脉补液</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重度</td>\n<td>精神萎靡、尿少无泪、休克征</td>\n<td>立即静脉补液</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>口服补液盐（ORS）是世界卫生组织推荐的一线方法，护士要教会家长正确冲配比例、少量多次喂服。准确记录大便次数和量、尿量，是评估补液效果的依据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"沟通与安抚\">沟通与安抚</h3><p>儿科护理多了一个&quot;双重对象&quot;——既要护理孩子，又要安抚家长。对孩子要用游戏化、鼓励式的方式减少恐惧；对家长要耐心解释、缓解焦虑。良好的沟通能大大提高操作的成功率，比如打针前先安抚、操作快准，远比强行按住更有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>某退烧药每公斤每次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mtext> mg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15\\ \\text{mg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mg</span></span></span></span></span></span>，一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext> kg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\ \\text{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的孩子单次该用多少？</li>\n<li>一个孩子高热惊厥发作，家长正要掐人中、撬开嘴，你应该怎么劝阻并正确处理？</li>\n<li>怎样从眼窝、皮肤弹性、尿量判断腹泻患儿的脱水程度？</li>\n<li>为什么说儿科护理的&quot;沟通对象&quot;是双重的？这对操作成功率有什么影响？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>了解口服补液盐（ORS）的正确冲配和喂服方法，这是降低婴幼儿腹泻死亡率的重要措施。</li>\n<li>关注 2026 年国家把儿科护士培训列为补短板重点的背景，儿科护理人才长期紧缺。</li>\n<li>查阅不同年龄段儿童生长发育里程碑，理解为什么儿科护理要&quot;按年龄分层&quot;对待。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>儿科护理的核心是牢记&quot;儿童不是缩小版成人&quot;。用药剂量必须按体重精算，先称体重再算剂量；高热惊厥要侧卧防误吸、不强行约束、记录时长；腹泻脱水要会分程度并指导口服补液盐；沟通对象是孩子加家长的双重组合。儿科病情变化快，护士的早期观察和冷静处置至关重要。下一节我们进入护理的&quot;快反部队&quot;——急危重症护理。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"儿科护理要点","id":"儿科护理要点"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"儿科用药：剂量按体重算","id":"儿科用药-剂量按体重算"},{"level":3,"text":"高热惊厥：先保安全","id":"高热惊厥-先保安全"},{"level":3,"text":"腹泻与脱水：看脱水程度补液","id":"腹泻与脱水-看脱水程度补液"},{"level":3,"text":"沟通与安抚","id":"沟通与安抚"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"母婴护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/specialty-nursing/maternal-and-child-nursing"},"next":{"title":"急危重症护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/specialty-nursing/emergency-and-critical-care-nursing"}}